               usm-service, vibe-service → springdoc-openapi-ui 1.6.6 (their original)
               icip-service, data-service → springdoc-openapi-starter-webmvc-ui 2.6.0 (their original)
             icip and data were already on 2.6.0 before the optimization — not an upgrade.  -->
        <springdoc-openapi.version>1.6.6</springdoc-openapi.version>
        <springdoc-openapi-starter.version>2.6.0</springdoc-openapi-starter.version>

        <!-- ── Database ──────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
